{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/神圣指引","pageid":7359,"revid":17650,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%A5%9E%E5%9C%A3%E6%8C%87%E5%BC%95&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%A5%9E%E5%9C%A3%E6%8C%87%E5%BC%95&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%A5%9E%E5%9C%A3%E6%8C%87%E5%BC%95&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>神圣指引</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.A5.9E.E5.9C.A3.E6.8C.87.E5.BC.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"神圣指引\"><b>神圣指引</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 神圣指引.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c8/5col3f9yre7d6srizrfm1zjiwzneto9.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%A5%9E%E5%9C%A3%E6%8C%87%E5%BC%95.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c8/5col3f9yre7d6srizrfm1zjiwzneto9.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%A5%9E%E5%9C%A3%E6%8C%87%E5%BC%95.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c8/5col3f9yre7d6srizrfm1zjiwzneto9.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />神圣指引\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>普攻\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（普攻）强制选中<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">140%</font>物理范围伤害。攻击后，选择目标地面，准备<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合，技能释放后，对目标地面范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>物理范围伤害。<br />✦本技能造成伤害时，目标每拥有1个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，伤害额外增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%95%99%E7%9A%87%E2%80%9D\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/第五灾厄“教皇”\"><img alt=\"第五灾厄“教皇” 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/n48d9cunkslr1hu0zxctv0s5j11rwwx.png/75px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%95%99%E7%9A%87%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/n48d9cunkslr1hu0zxctv0s5j11rwwx.png/113px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%95%99%E7%9A%87%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4